{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve framing for null invoke requests.** Returning `null` removes the handshake the target uses to decide whether to frame its output. With both sides opted in, a null request therefore makes an offloaded target result arrive unframed, and the caller passes the SDK envelope to user SerDes. Add an explicit versioned null representation that decodes to null while remaining framed, plus a null-request/offloaded-result integration test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okNG-","finding_digest":"bf1bbe23b54494d7ca85a0c6cb1158deec814d812efc1a9714d728340322a633","finding_id":"arf_v1_x4n34i5visknpsufuddmweky33","finding_key":"sdk/offload/internal/chainedinvokepayloadframe::encode::null-request-handshake-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/offload/internal/chainedinvokepayloadframe::encode::null-request-handshake-preservation","line":15,"observation_digest":"20cd9af5414800e252bbb3d7907688d21f3c5b77b15faf379b22a61db3477be7","observation_id":"aro_v1_edgzv5kbjaaoeuv3wplza5ui2i","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/internal/ChainedInvokePayloadFrame.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:35:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bnkytan6qbz2kkbfo5ofv5teg6","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e9f3957eec87467c5d8566ed014a6e592000f653","reviewer":"codex","start_line":14,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_3naary23mlxbo4emwhvmay4rqb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:35:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
